			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 790131901,
					"content": "就说怎么没有笔记本，原来是把留言刻在柱子上…这家伙成功到这儿啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790131902,
					"content": "不过，他到底哪来的信心…要是没有我们帮他，他早就困在遗迹的密室里了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790131903,
					"content": "他去雪山，一定会被冻成「冷鲜肉」的！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131904,
						790131906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790131904,
					"content": "「冷鲜肉」有点过分了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131905
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790131905,
					"content": "我、我是说，他去雪山，肯定会遭遇危险的啦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790131908,
					"content": "我们得告诉他，不能去雪山呀！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790131909,
					"content": "那就再给他留一次言吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131910
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 790131910,
					"content": "嗯嗯，我也是这么想的…对了，这一次，再准备一份甜甜花酿鸡！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 790131911,
					"content": "说不定他吃了甜甜花酿鸡，就会想起蒙德的温暖，不会去雪山了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						790131912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
